WEBVTT

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.540
Into The Wide World...

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.670
2100 A.D.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.670
- The Moon -

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.130
Here.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:39.100
If you keep pouting, your face is going to stay like that.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.060
I don't care.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:40.930
Here you go.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.020
Kurau...

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:47.190
The only person who can cause Dr. Amami
so much vexation is Miss Kurau.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.770
But... Tomorrow's special!

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:53.110
It's not that I forgot about your birthday...

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.570
It just slipped my mind.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:57.820
I'm sorry.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.830
Hey, isn't there anything you want? Tell me.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.290
I don't want anything.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:10.090
Just as you promised, I want to go to all sorts of places with you.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.210
Don't ask for the impossible.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.640
Do you want to come watch the experiment tomorrow?

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.510
You enjoy doing that, don't you?

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.350
Really?!

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:27.350
Let's have dinner after my work is done.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.690
We can go to buy you a present, too.

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.730
You can stay up late, if you like.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.740
Tomorrow is special. We'll talk all you want.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.740
Yay!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.450
Thanks, Dad!

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.700
Ella, I'll help you.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.540
Oh, you can leave it as is!

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:46.660
Oh... dear!

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:51.000
I wonder if I coddled her too much
because she lost her mother so young.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.460
Of course not.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.920
Miss Kurau is developing into
a gentle, wonderful child.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:57.970
Thank you, Ella.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.180
Don't mention it.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:32.420
Actually, I don't really care about
observing the experiment.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:34.920
I just love being with Dad.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.010
Oh, is that so?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:37.880
Yes.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:41.430
I don't really understand about
next-generation energy research.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.600
But Dad looks cool when he's working!

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.310
Completely different from when he's at home.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.100
Oh my!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.940
See you later, Miss Kurau!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.110
Hm? Rain?

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.860
Liquid sunshine! it's pretty.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.870
Isn't it, Dad?

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.490
For lunch we're having my specialty sandwiches.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.160
I'll look forward to that.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.580
Happy birthday, Kurau.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.870
Thank you!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.460
So, she's twelve already...

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.880
How time flies...

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.140
Kurau! You're here to observe?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.550
Yes.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.600
Oh, Kurau! it's been a while.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.850
Hello.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.480
Okay, let's start.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.480
Reactor stable.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.570
Countdown to release of electron beam will begin.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:39.150
All right... it's about to begin.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.070
9,

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.070
8,

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.150
7,

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.030
6,

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.070
5,

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:41.990
4,

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.030
3,

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.030
2,

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:44.740
1!

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.580
Reaction detected.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.580
It's the same as the last time.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.210
That's good. it's stable.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.260
Dr. Amami... the numbers!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.140
What?!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.560
What... is this?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.690
This is...

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.690
Dr. Amami, the figures have exceeded the safety standards.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:19.900
The data?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.280
We got it.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.610
Okay. Turn it off.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:23.400
Yes, sir.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:43.930
Nanika, mado Kara tobikomisoude
Something seems about to fly through the window

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.590
Kurau!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.430
What? What happ...

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.720
Where's Kurau?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:05:04.200
Kiniro ni ukabinagara Sora ni mukatte
In a golden glow, toward the sky...

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:03.740
Kurau!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.580
Tobu
It flies

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:18.670
Mousugu shiroi asa ga kuru
Soon, the white dawn will come

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.670
Kurau...

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:39.150
Ai wo makura ni korogatte ikiru
Rolling along, pillowed by love, it lives

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:42.690
Kurau!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:44.610
"Kurau"

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.070
What in the world?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.530
"What in the world?"

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.660
Are you hurt?

00:05:51.450 --> 00:06:01.460
Lonely Freedom

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.490
I am Rynax.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.750
These are legs.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.290
These are hands.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.960
This is a voice.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.500
These are words.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:11.180
Lonely Freedom

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.760
The wide world...

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:09.760
You... What happened?

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.640
You are Hajime Amami.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:20.980
Lonely Freedom

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.680
This body is Kurau Amami.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.190
You're the provider of the genes...

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.230
The father.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.400
Dr. Amami!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.400
I'm sorry...

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.950
Please leave me alone with Kurau.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.950
I can't believe it.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.000
It is not a matter of believing it or not.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.210
It is reality.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:45.170
So you insist... that you're that... Rynax?

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.550
What IS Rynax?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.550
It's the same question again.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.350
Rynax is Rynax.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.470
I came into this world because
your daughter called me.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.230
So tell me! Why would Kurau call you here?!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:02.150
If you're Rynax, where is Kurau?
Where did you send her?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.270
I have already answered that.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.690
I do not know why Kurau called me here.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:11.700
And you ask me where I sent her, but Kurau is here.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:18.160
Please... Give my daughter back to me.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.370
I told you Kurau is here.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.000
Please...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.540
Are you telling me to leave this body?

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.630
I do not know how I can do that.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:32.760
Besides, my Pair lies dormant in this body.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.550
Pair?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.770
Rynax live in pairs.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.560
Pairs...

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.150
Two... lights?

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:48.400
My Pair is weakened. It needs rest.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.570
This body is necessary for that reason, also.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.200
What am I supposed to do?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.830
What do you want to do?

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:08.050
Will you leave Kurau's body if you're with your Pair?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.050
Yes. If we are able to live together.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.340
I will find a way for you to do that.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.850
I want you to help me.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:17.810
All right.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.770
You don't have any pain anywhere?

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.810
No injuries?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.020
Nope! I'm fine!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.530
I can't believe... that you're not...

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.240
that you've changed...

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.880
Fantastic!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.670
Judging from the tests we've done,

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.960
all of her bodily functions
far exceed those of any human.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:55.890
Dr. Amami, our encounter with Rynax is a miracle!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.850
What do you mean "miracle"?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.850
True, she does have super-human powers...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.770
At the same time, she has
Kurau's data and memories.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:11.480
And those seem to increase day by day.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.200
Dad, let's go home!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.910
"Dad"... Before I knew it, she was calling me that.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:21.040
Wait, Kurau... We still have tests this afternoon.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:24.250
MORE tests? Come on, Dad!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:31.000
I am confused. Is she still my daughter?

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.630
Or is it too late?

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.960
M-Miss Kurau!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.750
It's dangerous for you to climb way up there!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.470
What are you doing? Get down here!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.430
You mustn't climb up there!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.720
Kurau!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.600
Oww...

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.100
Kurau...

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.480
Are you... Are you hurt, Kurau?

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.820
I'm not... hurt.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:38.740
I'm all right. I'm not hurt.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.240
That's...

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.160
That's my daughter's precious body.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:48.290
Please...

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.330
Don't be reckless.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:52.540
Please...

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.130
I understand. I will take care of it.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.470
I will not get hurt.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:12.100
It seems to me Miss Kurau hasn't changed much.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.570
She's still a bit of a tomboy.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.900
I would like to think so too, but it's not so.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.950
I've lost someone again.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:26.580
After losing my wife, I didn't want to lose anyone again.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.950
That child is Miss Kurau!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:31.540
Just this morning,

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:35.920
she said that she didn't like the tests,
but she was happy to be with her dad.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.630
That child IS Miss Kurau!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.500
Keep on holding me

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.500
What?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:19.380
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.000
Kurau...

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.010
What... is this?

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:32.020
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:27.720
Rynax... You...

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:37.360
The precious arms

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:43.240
I have been searching for so hard

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:38.650
Why do you cry?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.780
I'm happy.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.030
You are happy, but you cry?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.610
That's right.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:50.540
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:47.700
That's right, Kurau.

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.700
I see...

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.870
I see, you're happy.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:59.380
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:55.500
When you're happy I'm happy too!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:03.090
You are... my daughter.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:06.970
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.430
Yes!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.390
Dad!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.510
10 Years Later

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:14.890
But if you remain by my side

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.470
2110 A.D.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.470
- Earth -

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:18.650
Keep on holding me

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:22.320
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:29.740
I want to protect this love for always

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.740
Who is it?

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.320
Where are you, Kurau? I've got a job for you.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.200
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:34.410
This love...

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.800
This'll only take a minute.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:48.800
Major pod manufacturer System Square's
top-secret data has been stolen.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.850
They're probably aiming to sell it to a rival firm.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.560
This is someone I know well.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.980
Oh? A fellow thief?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:03.320
He does anything for money.
That's the job of an Agent.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.780
Oh?! I would never betray a client.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.950
This guy has gone too far.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:14.040
And? Just what is this job?

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:19.040
The stolen data chip is locked, of course,
but it's only a matter of time before it's accessed.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.130
Others may be after it, as well.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.750
I want you to recover it at once.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.550
We even know where he is. This should be easy.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.130
And? What about the perp?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.300
Our aim is recovery. Let him be.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.100
You're easy on old friends.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.390
Kurau!

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:38.770
Be careful. He probably knows that someone's after him.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.020
This is easy.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.980
Get out of here, will you?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.320
Sure, sure...

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.450
You haven't changed, have you Kurau?

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.160
I have no interest in his reasons.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.330
You'd do anything for money, eh?

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:01.000
It's the truth. I don't care.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.630
If I concentrate on my job,
I can forget unpleasant things.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:07.050
You have something you want to forget?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.220
Limited-time-only sales at the supermarkets.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.180
Huh?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.760
I missed one.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:13.800
What are you talking about?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.610
Anything?

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.320
Nothing. What about you?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.530
No change. He's in his room.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.530
You might run right into him.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.650
No.3 
Residential Area

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.700
You sound happy.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.530
Do I?

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:39.330
I hear you've been taking all
the real dangerous jobs, lately.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.710
All the Agents are talking about it.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:45.210
Fun jobs are better than boring ones, right?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.840
Fun, huh?

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:52.220
I'll bet your parents are worried
because their daughter's an Agent.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.260
Not really...

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.600
There are some who call you
"Reckless" Kurau, you know.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.230
Mike! That's not true!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:04.560
I've decided never to get hurt or to die.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.520
You've decided, huh?

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.230
He's on the move!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:12.860
Okay, as planned, you break into his room.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.490
I'll cover the exit.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.290
I'm in.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.960
You could win first prize in the B&E contest.

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.170
How do you do it?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.220
Teach me next time, will you?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.300
It's a secret.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.800
Then, just a tip...

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.020
Who knows? Maybe I'm using magic.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.490
Hey, he's not coming out.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.200
Wallet... my wallet...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.450
He's here.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.420
Kurau!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.420
I took care of him.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.130
It's here! Be careful!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.610
He's looking away... I'll go this way!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.100
Bye-bye!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.040
Are you all right?

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.620
I heard rumors about an unbelievable woman...

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.370
You're Kurau?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.290
You're an Agent, too?

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.710
What rotten luck.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.090
Oww...

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.210
See you around...

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.180
I guess he won't be getting paid.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:43.560
That's how it goes. I didn't get to
do much this time, either.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:47.230
If you take care of that, I could
give you some consideration.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.400
Okay... I'll take care of the rest.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.650
Anyway, it's MY car.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.320
I'll leave the goods to you. You got it, right?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:02.780
Gotcha...

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.440
Hey...

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.160
Are you here?

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:45.490
If you are, please answer me.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.330
I've been waiting a good ten years.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.710
Please... wake up.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:10.480
I'm alone in this world, without my Pair.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.380
I'm home!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.390
Welcome back...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:24.050
I'm sorry for taking so long.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:36.690
I've been longing to see you!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.950
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.950
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.290
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.290
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:05.420
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:05.420
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.350 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:22:53.350 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.870
Next Episode

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:12.700
What shall we do after we eat?

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:14.280
Do you want to see the town?

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:17.040
Oh, yes! We have to buy you some clothes, too.

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:18.790
Something you'll look good in.

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:21.920
That's right! We have to think of a name for you!

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.880
A Good Word
